From 773763de5bd2d5b1e77b451bb85b1cf3e6d3ff16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cool <bilibili@att.net>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:02:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] mesa: preserve local compatibility and offline wrap
 metadata

Keep local Tegra/Freedreno compatibility, feature documentation and pick
metadata. Preserve URL-stripped wraps and Meson package patches.
Dependency archives are fetched separately using the patch repository helper.

